
---
import Layout from "../Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | MakautNetwork"
  description="Know about Makaut Network and its motive"
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#071426] lg:px-4 lg:py-2 text-white px-6 py-16">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-emerald-400">
        About MakautNetwork
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
        Making student life a little easier
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
        University life is very complicated from jobs, marks, grades and exams
        to study materials and activities. Finding reliable exam updates, study resources, and career guidance shouldn’t be complicated.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-slate-300">
        Makaut Network is a student-focused platform built to bring useful academic
        tools and resources together in one place. Our aim is to help MAKAUT
        students spend less time searching and more time focusing on their studies
        and goals.
      </p>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">What you can find here</h2>

        <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0d1e33] p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-emerald-300">Academic tools</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
              Calculators for checking grade points and working out academic results.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0d1e33] p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-emerald-300">Study resources</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
              Useful learning materials and information to support your preparation.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0d1e33] p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-emerald-300">Student activities</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
              Information about activities and opportunities to take part beyond
              regular coursework.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0d1e33] p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-emerald-300">Academic updates</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
              Student-focused updates and information relevant to university life.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Our approach</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          We want the website to be straightforward to use. Tools should be easy to
          understand, instructions should be clear, and information should help
          answer a real question rather than add more confusion.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-emerald-400/20 bg-emerald-400/[0.06] p-5 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Have a suggestion?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          If you find an error, have an idea for a useful tool, or want to share
          feedback, we would like to hear from you.
        </p>
        <a
          href="mailto:contact@makaut.net"
          class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-400 px-4 py-2.5 font-semibold text-[#071426] transition hover:bg-emerald-300"
        >
          Contact us
        </a>
      </section>

      <p class="mt-8 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
        MakautNetwork is an independent student resource website. It is not an
        official website of Maulana Abul Kalam Azad University of Technology
        (MAKAUT).
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
